  "title": "The theorem asks only for an attribution at a time",
  "statements": [
    {
      "id": "d624249c-0ede-44c8-91b0-d66a6ac82e03",
      "text": "The theorem assumes only that a theory gives a consciousness attribution at a specified time. It does not assume that consciousness is instantaneous, and does not deny that experience may be temporally extended.",
